 "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Evilos is an action tower defense game where you play as an ancient evil sorcerer battling endless waves of do-gooders. Tear down the kingdom with a vast arsenal of evolvable magic weapons and spells, and bolster your defenses with elite minions across 10 acts. This time, you are the final boss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/4b11135c0d1be004d47e0cdf9785fffc.poster.avif?t=1787149174\" width=1170 height=772 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/4b11135c0d1be004d47e0cdf9785fffc.webm?t=1787149174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/4b11135c0d1be004d47e0cdf9785fffc.mp4?t=1787149174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Annihilate all the heroes with meteors, tornadoes, lightning and more devastating spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/df9967b66b1e1cdb9c0f3b60cb7127ce.poster.avif?t=1787149174\" width=1170 height=772 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/df9967b66b1e1cdb9c0f3b60cb7127ce.webm?t=1787149174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/df9967b66b1e1cdb9c0f3b60cb7127ce.mp4?t=1787149174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unleash your arsenal of magic-imbued guns to freeze, burn, electrocute and disintegrate your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/78e5d0c60b71345c427883741fdb71ab.poster.avif?t=1787149174\" width=1170 height=772 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/78e5d0c60b71345c427883741fdb71ab.webm?t=1787149174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/78e5d0c60b71345c427883741fdb71ab.mp4?t=1787149174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Raise the dead to serve as your personal bodyguards. Jack Marrow, Nicolas Ribcage, Scary Potter, Vincent Van Gore and Arnold Schwarzenecro await your command!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/c36f74f99106de7be49ebcf61aad0a2f.poster.avif?t=1787149174\" width=1170 height=772 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/c36f74f99106de7be49ebcf61aad0a2f.webm?t=1787149174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/c36f74f99106de7be49ebcf61aad0a2f.mp4?t=1787149174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Upgrade and evolve your weapons and spells into deadlier new forms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/1b549e6fef664f4a306b6157145df790.poster.avif?t=1787149174\" width=1170 height=772 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/1b549e6fef664f4a306b6157145df790.webm?t=1787149174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/1b549e6fef664f4a306b6157145df790.mp4?t=1787149174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Exact your revenge upon the world across 10 acts spanning the kingdom, each ending in a challenging boss fight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play the villain</strong> — an ancient evil sorcerer, awakened after a thousand years to reclaim his stolen power</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A cursed arsenal</strong> — discover tons of weapon and spell combinations and create beautifully evil synergies to destroy your enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade &amp; evolve</strong> — each weapon and spell can be upgraded and evolved into a deadlier final form</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raise the dead</strong> — command the fallen champions as your personal minions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A kingdom to conquer</strong> — 100 levels across 10 acts, each ending in an epic boss battle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>The kingdom sealed you away and called it a happy ending. Time to rewrite it — wishlist Evilos and become the final boss.</i></strong></p>",
 "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Evilos is an action tower defense game where you play as an ancient evil sorcerer battling endless waves of do-gooders. Tear down the kingdom with a vast arsenal of evolvable magic weapons and spells, and bolster your defenses with elite minions across 10 acts. This time, you are the final boss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/4b11135c0d1be004d47e0cdf9785fffc.poster.avif?t=1787149174\" width=1170 height=772 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/4b11135c0d1be004d47e0cdf9785fffc.webm?t=1787149174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/4b11135c0d1be004d47e0cdf9785fffc.mp4?t=1787149174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Annihilate all the heroes with meteors, tornadoes, lightning and more devastating spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/df9967b66b1e1cdb9c0f3b60cb7127ce.poster.avif?t=1787149174\" width=1170 height=772 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/df9967b66b1e1cdb9c0f3b60cb7127ce.webm?t=1787149174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035770/extras/df9967b66b1e1cdb9c0f3b60cb7127ce.mp4?t=1787149174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unleash your arsenal of magic-imbued guns to freeze, burn,